into `third_party/potplayer-whisper` (from
`C:\Program Files\DAUM\PotPlayer\Module\Whisper`).

Those binaries and related files are proprietary to PotPlayer / Kakao Corp
(or its licensors). They are:

- not part of the upPlayer MIT-licensed codebase
